0326-negroni-wlan-api: Wi-Fi, the seam for the iOS side (bsd/dev/negroni_wlan_api.h) and the scan list.
New negroni_wlan_api.h (plain C: version, caps, register callbacks, link state, scan + scan results, associate,
disassociate, 802.3 TX/RX), negroni_wlan_sta.{c,h} (API state under a mutex, the BSS list of every beacon / probe
response with security (RSN AKM/cipher) and the elements a join needs, scan requests serviced on the driver thread),
negroni_wlan_join.c (ENOTSUP placeholders until 0327-0329). negroni_wlan.c: state STARTING/IDLE/FAILED/OFF, the
keep-alive loop runs the station service. negroni_wlan_wmi.c: every MGMT_RX frame goes to the station manager,
negroni_wlan_wmi_scan_start for later scans. Details: patches/xnu/README-wifi.md "0326".

